      "body": "## Structure tree\n\n```\n.\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 .git/\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 .ipynb_checkpoints/\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 .opencode/          \u2190 NEW  (project config for opencode CLI)\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 AGENTS.md           \u2190 NEW  (agent instructions)\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 Main_chat.chat\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 Main.chat\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 My_Project/\n\u2514\u2500\u2500 README.md\n```\n\n## Commentary\n\n| Item | Status | Notes |\n|------|--------|-------|\n| `.opencode/` | Created | Empty directory; serves as the project-level configuration root for the `opencode` tool. Runtime config (conversation state, local settings, etc.) will be stored here automatically. |\n| `AGENTS.md` | Created | Contains environment constraints (Python 3.12, no internet, work confined to CWD), working conventions, code style rules, file safety constraints, and communication guidelines \u2014 all tailored to the Intro to AI Homework 2 context. |\n\nAll pre-existing files and directories were left untouched.",
