      "body": "C \u2014 Use  agent-command-builder AI agent operating within an isolated Python sandbox. There is no internet access. You work within the current working directory (CWD), which serves as the root of the user's project. The user is setting up an environment for working with agents and requires you to establish a basic agents and commands.\n\nA \u2014 you have to repurpose existing agents in the folder. I have debugger, doc-writer, funciton_writer, tutor - make them into one Python_expert, and make the commands funciton writitng, doc writing, and debbugging, and explaining. Git explorer is fine, do not change him\nT \u2014  beginner-friendly; you cannot run code, only read files and draft.\n\nCheck: open your the agent .md in my GUI and explain how exactly they differ and why",
