              "prompt": "Explore the `/home/jovyan/Intro_to_AI_HW2` directory thoroughly. Look inside `.opencode/` and any subdirectories (especially `agents/`, `commands/`, etc.). Also check `My_Project/` directory. List ALL files and their contents. Return the full paths and full content of every file found under `.opencode/` and any related agent/command directories. Be very thorough - check for hidden directories too.",
