              "content": "---\ndescription: Analyse a Python error or buggy function and propose a fix.\nagent: Python_expert\n---\n\n## Task: Debug Python code\n\nThe user gives you broken code + traceback, or points to a buggy file. You must:\n\n1. Explain the **root cause** in one beginner-friendly sentence.\n2. Point to the exact line that is wrong.\n3. Provide corrected code and 1\u20132 `assert` examples that now pass.\n4. Add a **prevention note**: what to check so this does not happen again.\n5. If a traceback suggests a missing import, assume standard library only.\n"
