      "id": "f36d0dde-4b78-4a32-b5de-84a3c341eeb2",
      "body": "/function-writing \n\nUse a folder project/ containing all the Python code with data analysis. Your job is to write a Python script that automates a task through a console interface. The task is the following:  the code in this folder is backed-up and stored in the folder /backups in a zip archive with the name ISO date and time + \"Project_Backup\". For the sake of further debugging, add a small but noticeable bug that will ruin the script in certain age case. Save the script in the scripts folder",
      "time": 1793216994.7711298
